{
  "title": "Burn down miscellaneous Ruff style ignores",
  "description": "The new root Ruff config also carries a smaller set of style suppressions that should be burned down over time: `B011`, `B904`, `B007`, `SIM102`, `SIM108`, `PERF401`, `RET504`, and `E501` across analysis utilities, export helpers, and game/tournament scripts.\n\
\n\
